@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5266

### KDS: active orders
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### KDS: active order items
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items
Accept: application/json

###

### KDS: filter items by status
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items?status=Preparing
Accept: application/json

###

### KDS: accept an item
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items/1/accept

###

### KDS: start preparing an item
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items/1/start

###

### KDS: mark an item ready
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items/1/ready

###

### KDS: mark an item served
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/order-items/1/served

###

### KDS: summary
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/kds/summary
Accept: application/json

###

### Notifications for a user
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications?userId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a user's notification
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/1?userId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Mark a user's notification as read
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/1/read?userId=1

###

### Mark all of a user's notifications as read
PATCH {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/read-all?userId=1

###

### Delete a user's notification
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/1?userId=1

###

# SignalR hub: {{backend_HostAddress}}/hubs/orders
# Invoke JoinOrder(orderId) to subscribe to OrderItemStatusChanged events.
# Kitchen displays invoke JoinKitchen() to receive status updates for all active orders.
# SignalR hub: {{backend_HostAddress}}/hubs/notifications
# Invoke JoinUserNotifications(userId) to subscribe to NotificationsChanged events.
